# Machines `box` knows about. One per line; add a machine by adding a line.
# name    lan host        tailscale ip      roles: default = used when no machine is named,
#                                                  proxy = runs CLIProxyAPI (Claude accounts live there)
#                                                  mac = Art's MacBook (no Ubuntu services; reachable once Remote Login is on)
#                                                  windows = a Windows PC: SSH only, never an agent box, skipped by "all" and every sync
#                                                  macbox = an agent box running macOS (launchd, Screen Sharing); Claude via the proxy
